# Locally-downloaded lint tooling (CI installs its own — 722-ci.yml builds
# actionlint from source and the runner image ships shellcheck). These land in
# the repo root when a sandbox session lints by hand, and `git add -A` then
# sweeps ~9MB of binary into the branch (caught on #910).
/actionlint
/actionlint.exe
shellcheck
shellcheck_py-*.whl
